- No.

00:09:36.666 --> 00:09:37.916
(sniffling) I finally got

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:40.943
an SRO.
- Oh, that's nice.

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:45.380
But you were on the street for a while?

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:46.213
- Yeah.

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:53.030
I was in between

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:56.810
like,

00:09:56.810 --> 00:10:01.083
with this guy I had
met and on the streets.

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:05.923
It's hard for me on the streets.

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:08.783
People think I'm just,

00:10:13.990 --> 00:10:15.700
