00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:17.550
And they try to take advantage of me.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:22.323
I've been robbed.

00:10:37.165 --> 00:10:40.113
(sighing)

00:10:40.113 --> 00:10:42.446
(sniffling)

00:10:47.717 --> 00:10:49.760
I don't think I would be able to get by

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:52.563
