00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:18.780
I'll talk to 'em.

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:20.920
- [Interviewer] But not real friends.

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:22.583
Do you have anyone that you trust?

00:11:24.293 --> 00:11:26.407
(sniffling)

00:11:26.407 --> 00:11:27.730
- No.
- Are you here mainly just

00:11:27.730 --> 00:11:31.143
'cause that's where the
drugs are easy to find?

00:11:31.143 --> 00:11:36.143
- No.

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:37.863
My favorite place is the beach.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:40.633
And like,

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:47.910
I like the point that it's
just a 45-minute train ride,

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:48.743
